---
/* A news card: the round photo over three columns, the source and the date one column apart, the title in h3, the
   text at half strength and « Read ». Spaces from the roles: picture to text, meta to title, title to text, text to
   its link. */
import Img from "@/components/media/Img.astro";
import ArrowLink from "@/components/content/ArrowLink.astro";
import type { NewsItem } from "@/data/news.ts";

interface Props {
  /** Set to `false` to omit the component. */
  render?: boolean;
  /** The news. */
  item: NewsItem;
  /** Its place in the list, for OP System's Modifier. */
  index?: number;
  /** More classes, for where a list places it. */
  class?: string;
  /** How much faster or slower than the page it travels (src/utils/parallax.ts). */
  depth?: number;
}

const { render = true, item, index = 0, class: extra, depth } = Astro.props;
---

{
  render && (
    <article class:list={["card-news", extra]} data-op-item={String(index)} data-parallax={depth || undefined} style={`--_order: ${index}`}>
      <div class="card-news_media">
        <Img class="card-news_img" src={item.photo} alt={item.alt} variant="constrained" sizes="(min-width: 64rem) 24vw, (min-width: 48rem) 38vw, 75vw" />
      </div>
      <p class="card-news_meta text-style-main">
        <span data-op-field="source">{item.source}</span>
        <span data-op-field="date">{item.date}</span>
      </p>
      <h2 class="card-news_title text-style-h3" data-op-field="title">
        {item.title}
      </h2>
      <p class="card-news_text text-style-main" data-op-field="text">
        {item.text}
      </p>
      <ArrowLink class="card-news_link" href={item.href} text="Read" />
    </article>
  )
}

<style is:global>
  @layer components {
    .card-news {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      column-gap: var(--site-gutter);
      align-content: start;
      @media (width >= 64rem) {
        grid-template-columns: subgrid;
      }
    }
    .card-news_media {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
      position: relative;
      aspect-ratio: 1;
      border-radius: var(--radius-round);
      overflow: clip;
      background-color: var(--background-2);
    }
    .card-news_img {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
    }
    .card-news_meta {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: subgrid;
      margin-top: var(--space-media);
      & span:last-child {
        grid-column: 2 / -1;
      }
    }
    .card-news_title {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
      margin-top: var(--space-meta);
    }
    .card-news_text {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
      margin-top: var(--space-title);
      color: var(--text-2);
    }
    .card-news_link {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
      justify-self: start;
      margin-top: var(--space-action);
    }
  }
</style>
